        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSB4x-RZ 4\" x 4\" x Square Corners, Residential Solid Brass Hinge, ZigZag Holes</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching solid brass flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 1\" wood screws and standard removable button tip finials. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, rust resistant, stainless steel pin. Utilizes Non-template ZigZag screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"300\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DSB4xRZ-specification.jpg?v=1704354638\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSB4x-RZ Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4 Inch Residential Brass Hinge ZigZag Holes:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\"</li>\r\n<li>ZigZag Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DSB4xRZ-specification.pdf?v=1704262164\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSB4x-RZ- Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\">finishes</a> for this hinge, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't forget to look at <a href=\"/collections/deltana-brass-hinge-finials\">Deltana's Brass Hinge Finials</a> to spice up your hinges!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
