                "description": "4 x 4 Solid Brass Hinge, ZigZag Holes, Square Corners 0.085 thich (gauge). Package includes a pair of hinges, matching solid brass flathead, Phillips screws and standard removable button tip finials. Available in 6 different finishes. ",
